---
description: Unit and widget test conventions
globs: test/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---

# Tests

- Put tests in `test/` mirroring `lib/`. Shared mocks go in
  `test/helpers/mocks.dart` (mocktail). Prefer `firebase_auth_mocks` for
  auth flows; use mocktail when it cannot cover the case.
- Test pure logic directly (`authRedirect`, validators, `AuthFailure`).
  Do not stand up widgets to test a function.
- Widget tests override providers, they do not touch Firebase:

```dart
await tester.pumpWidget(
  ProviderScope(
    overrides: [
      authRepositoryProvider.overrideWithValue(repository),
    ],
    child: MaterialApp.router(routerConfig: router),
  ),
);
```

- Find form controls by `Key` (`sign-in-email`, `sign-in-submit`). Add a
  `Key` on a new interactive control that a test will tap or fill.
- Reset `tester.view` and dispose `GoRouter` with `addTearDown`.
- Run `flutter test --dart-define-from-file=config/app_config.json`.
  A plain `flutter test` misses `AppConfig` values.
